==Battleground==
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Units]] like [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to deal with the enemies.

